# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore: Northeast India Airy Isostasy Analysis
# ==============================================================================
# DATA-VERSIONING POLICY:
# 1. Raw Input Datasets (data/raw/):
#    - Large external raw source files (satellite gravity grids, DEMs, global crustal models)
#      must NEVER be committed to Git. They should be fetched deterministically via
#      ingestion scripts (e.g., using pooch) or archived in scientific repositories (Zenodo/OSF).
# 2. Processed Datasets (data/processed/):
#    - Heavy intermediate/processed raster grids (.nc, .tif, .grd, .h5) are excluded to prevent
#      repository bloat.
#    - Lightweight, reproducible processed outputs (profile CSVs, seismic station compilations,
#      bounding box masks, GeoJSON boundaries, metadata manifests) ARE tracked in version control.
# 3. Final Tables & Figures (results/):
#    - Final summary tables (results/tables/*.csv, *.tsv, *.tex, *.md) and audited configurations
#      (config/*.yaml) are tracked for scientific transparency, citation, and auditability.
#    - Large temporary cache files, binary dumps, and scratch plots are excluded.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Python Bytecode & Compilation Artifacts ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# --- Python Virtual Environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# --- Jupyter Notebook Artifacts ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*-checkpoint.ipynb
.virtual_documents/

# --- IDEs, Text Editors & Operating System Files ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Environment Configurations & Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Testing & Code Coverage ---
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/

# --- Raw Scientific Datasets (Always Excluded) ---
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# --- Large Binary, Archive, and Grid Data Formats ---
# Exclude multi-megabyte/gigabyte raster grids across data and temporary directories
*.nc
*.nc4
*.grd
*.tif
*.tiff
*.geotiff
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.dat
*.bin
*.xyz
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.7z

# --- Whitelist: Allow Small, Reproducible Processed Data Products ---
# Allow tracking of lightweight tabular products, vector profiles, manifests, and metadata
!data/processed/*.csv
!data/processed/*.tsv
!data/processed/*.json
!data/processed/*.geojson
!data/processed/*.yaml
!data/processed/*.yml
!data/processed/*.txt
!data/processed/*.md
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# --- Backup & Temporary Files ---
*.bak
*.tmp

# --- Results Management ---
# Keep temporary scratch outputs and caches excluded
results/scratch/
results/tmp/
results/**/*.tmp
results/**/*.bak

# Track final reproducible tables, figure manifests, and directory markers
!results/tables/*
!results/tables/.gitkeep
!results/figures/.gitkeep
!results/maps/.gitkeep
